#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
run.py — Local-first master pipeline orchestrator.

Pipeline:
    ingest
    -> language detection
    -> NLP extraction
    -> local embeddings
    -> knowledge graph
    -> policy planning
    -> optional isolated simulation
    -> evaluation
    -> policy update
    -> protocol lock
    -> report
    -> optional safe Playwright UI audit

Safety:
    - Simulation is disabled unless --enable-simulator is supplied.
    - No physical laboratory execution is implemented.
    - No protocol is locked without a successful evaluation.
    - Uploaded files are size-limited and never executed.
    - Raw file bytes, credentials, and embedding vectors are excluded
      from audit records.
    - UI testing skips destructive and unapproved controls.
    - Missing services cause explicit failures, not fake success.

Install:
    pip install aiohttp motor pypdf python-docx langdetect
    pip install playwright
    playwright install chromium

Optional local services:
    Ollama:       http://127.0.0.1:11434
    Policy API:   http://127.0.0.1:8000
    React UI:     http://127.0.0.1:3000
    MongoDB:      mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017

Run:
    python run.py ./example.pdf
    python run.py ./example.pdf --enable-simulator
    python run.py ./example.pdf --test-ui
"""

